  description: This benchmark focuses on securing worker nodes within an EKS cluster,
    ensuring proper configuration and monitoring.
  mitigation_strategies:
  - Use a dedicated Kubernetes service account with limited privileges.
  - Restrict access to the Kubelet cluster using Role-Based Access Control (RBAC).
  - Implement network policies to control communication between worker nodes and the
    control plane.
  - "Monitor the worker node\u2019s logs for abnormal activity."
  name: 'CIS Control 3: Worker Nodes'
